MINION 3
#TEST SOLCOUNT 0
# Regression (VecNeqDynamic family): when both vector entries at the deciding
# index are the same variable, the x<x pruning was not re-triggered because
# the watch was attached after propagating. Should be unsatisfiable.
**VARIABLES**
DISCRETE y {-9..-7}
**SEARCH**
PRINT[[y]]
**CONSTRAINTS**
watchvecexists_less([-7, y], [y, y])
**EOF**
